<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee again suspended all molasses import duties on Wednesday, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no change to import duties for either cane or beet molassses which remain suspended at zero,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.54 ecus per 100 kg compared with 8.40 ecus last week. The reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.35 ecus per 100 kg compared with 12.34 ecus last week.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom: +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
